OVERVIEW
The Universal Immersive Experience Generator v4.0 is a comprehensive framework for transforming single creative concepts into fully realized, data-driven immersive productions. This version integrates a complete database architecture enabling real-time operational management, API connectivity with business tools, and normalized metrics tracking.
What's New in v4.0
	•	Complete Supabase database schema with 45+ normalized tables
	•	Open API architecture for integration with Slack, Notion, Airtable, Monday, Asana
	•	Normalized metrics and KPI tracking across all production dimensions
	•	Webhook system for real-time event notifications
	•	Row Level Security for multi-tenant SaaS deployment
	•	Comprehensive audit logging and compliance tracking
Core Methodologies
5 Senses Framework: Systematic activation of Sight, Sound, Touch, Taste, and Smell to create multi-dimensional experiences.
XYZ Spatial-Temporal Foundation: Three-axis design covering Distance (X), Space (Y), and Time (Z) for scalable execution.
URL→IRL Lifecycle: Five-phase guest journey from Digital Pre-Event through Physical Event to Digital Post-Event.
Data-Driven Operations: Real-time database integration enabling API-connected production management.
